Chapter: PageSandbox
  cites Foreword chapter Maybe
  cites Browser chapter TrustManager
  cites Browser chapter ContentAddress
  cites Foreword chapter ListUtils
  cites Foreword chapter StringUtils

 The capability gate. Verifies a page's declared effect profile
 against the user's trust decisions before allowing execution.
 Pages that exceed their granted capabilities are rejected at
 compile time (effect type mismatch) — the sandbox is the
 runtime policy layer on top.

 Capability tiers:
   Static      [Display]                 no consent needed
   Connected   [Display, Network]        implicit for trusted
   Interactive [Display, Network, Storage]  prompted
   Sensor      [Display, ..., Camera]    explicit per-device
   System      [Display, ..., FileSystem] explicit + high trust

Section: Types

  SandboxVerdict =
    | SandboxAllow
    | SandboxPrompt (CapabilityTier) (List Text)
    | SandboxDeny (Text)

  SandboxConfig = record {
    sb-max-source-bytes  : Integer,
    sb-max-compile-ticks : Integer,
    sb-auto-trust-static : Boolean
  }

Section: Default Configuration

  sandbox-default-config : SandboxConfig
  sandbox-default-config =
    SandboxConfig {
      sb-max-source-bytes = 1048576,
      sb-max-compile-ticks = 10000,
      sb-auto-trust-static = True
    }

Section: Verification

  sandbox-check : SandboxConfig, TrustStore, Maybe (List Integer), PageCapabilities -> SandboxVerdict
  sandbox-check (config) (store) (publisher) (caps) =
    if caps.pc-tier == TierStatic
    then if config.sb-auto-trust-static
      then SandboxAllow
      else SandboxPrompt (TierStatic) (caps.pc-effects)
    else when publisher
      is None -> SandboxPrompt (caps.pc-tier) (caps.pc-effects)
      is Just (pub-key) ->
        let verdict = check-page-trust store pub-key caps
        in when verdict
          is TrustGranted -> SandboxAllow
          is TrustNeeded (tier) -> SandboxPrompt (tier) (caps.pc-effects)
          is TrustEscalation (requested) (granted) ->
            SandboxPrompt (requested) (caps.pc-effects)

Section: Source Size Gate

  sandbox-check-source-size : SandboxConfig, Integer -> SandboxVerdict
  sandbox-check-source-size (config) (size) =
    if size > config.sb-max-source-bytes
    then SandboxDeny ("Source too large: " & show size & " bytes (limit: " & show config.sb-max-source-bytes & ")")
    else SandboxAllow

Section: Embedding Capabilities

 The factory pattern for page embedding. An embedded page's
 capabilities are derived from the embedder's capabilities —
 never escalated. Revocation cascades from parent to child.

  CapabilityGrant = record {
    cg-effect : Text,
    cg-scope  : GrantScope
  }

  GrantScope =
    | GrantFull
    | GrantReadOnly
    | GrantOriginOnly

  can-embed-with : PageCapabilities, List CapabilityGrant -> SandboxVerdict
  can-embed-with (parent-caps) (grants) =
    if all-grants-within-parent parent-caps.pc-effects grants
    then SandboxAllow
    else SandboxDeny "Embedded page requests capabilities beyond parent"

  all-grants-within-parent : List Text, List CapabilityGrant -> Boolean
  all-grants-within-parent (parent-effects) (grants) =
    if list-length grants == 0 then True
    else let head = list-at grants 0
        in if list-any parent-effects (text-eq head.cg-effect)
          then all-grants-within-parent parent-effects (list-drop grants 1)
          else False
